    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=635000919318070022&sectionId=635000919402021638)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLnGGDLgV5_text","label":"ggLnGGDLgV5_text","default":"<p>Some photographs become meaningful because of what happened before or after they were taken.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>An image from a family vacation might remind everyone of the unexpected adventure that happened that day. A childhood picture might bring back stories that have been told around the dinner table for years. A photograph of a pet might remind you of all the little things that made them part of the family.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Turning that photograph into a Memobrick does not replace the original memory. It gives you another way to keep the story visible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Years from now, someone may look at the mosaic and ask about the photograph. You can tell them the story all over again.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPIgGYMHFw_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggPIgGYMHFw_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/dc80cb2a-ba52-4ea5-a23c-3d5ec09afe0c.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPIgGYMHFw_alt","label":"ggPIgGYMHFw_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPIgGYMHFw_title","label":"ggPIgGYMHFw_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCHNzFX81s_text","label":"ggCHNzFX81s_text","default":"The Photograph Does Not Have to Be Perfect"},{"type":"html","id":"ggs5cpA7vE3_text","label":"ggs5cpA7vE3_text","default":"<p>A common mistake when choosing a photograph for a keepsake is looking only for the most polished image.</p><p>But memories are rarely perfect.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes the person is laughing instead of posing. Someone is looking away from the camera. The lighting is not ideal. A pet is doing something ridiculous in the background.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those imperfections can be exactly what makes the photograph special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the picture makes you smile when you see it, that emotional connection may matter far more than whether it looks like it belongs in a professional photoshoot.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwLw9iC0af_text","label":"ggwLw9iC0af_text","default":"Your Favorite Memories Can Come From Anywhere"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLoDjoAwJd_text","label":"ggLoDjoAwJd_text","default":"<p>A meaningful keepsake does not have to represent a major life event.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Some of the best photographs come from ordinary days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A weekend drive. A meal with friends. A walk with your dog. A favorite corner of a city. A spontaneous road trip. A funny moment that nobody planned.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These everyday photographs can become meaningful precisely because they capture life as it really happened.</p><p>That also means there is no single type of photograph that works for everyone. The right choice depends on the person receiving the gift and the memories they value most.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWX5kCdW0i_text","label":"ggWX5kCdW0i_text","default":"<p>Once the mosaic is complete, it can move from being an activity to becoming part of the recipient's space.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family photograph might become a piece of living room décor. A travel memory could sit in an office or bedroom. A pet portrait might have a special place in the home. A car or motorcycle photograph could fit naturally into a garage, workspace, or hobby room.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wherever it goes, the finished piece gives the photograph a permanent place in someone's surroundings rather than leaving it hidden among thousands of digital images.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2vz9lxCb__text","label":"gg2vz9lxCb__text","default":"Choosing the Right Size"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdQTzbp-mi_text","label":"ggdQTzbp-mi_text","default":"<p>The photograph you choose should also influence the size of your Memobrick. A close up image with one main subject can work well in a smaller format, while photographs containing several people, pets, vehicles, or intricate details may benefit from a larger size.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For cars and motorcycles, sizes such as 30x20 or 40x30 can provide more room for recognizable features and details. A larger format can help give important parts of the subject enough space to stand out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Before choosing your size, consider the photograph itself, how much detail it contains, and where you would like the finished mosaic to be displayed.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghOhTKi3Mt_text","label":"gghOhTKi3Mt_text","default":"Made With More Than Technology"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZRRdxx-UI_text","label":"ggZRRdxx-UI_text","default":"<p>At Memobrick, technology can assist with the creative process while people review and refine the result. We check for mistakes, make adjustments when necessary, and pay attention to details that help the final mosaic represent the customer's photograph as well as possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That human attention matters because every photograph is different. Some images have complex backgrounds, others have multiple subjects, and some require adjustments to make important details work better in a brick mosaic.</p><p><strong>Technology helps us create it. People make sure we get it right.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is nothing wrong with keeping your favorite photographs on your phone. Digital albums make it easy to carry thousands of memories with you wherever you go.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But some photographs deserve to be seen without having to open an app.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They deserve a place where you can walk past them every day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They deserve to become part of the room, part of the conversation, and part of the story of your home.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglMrslVYos_text","label":"gglMrslVYos_text","default":"REVIEW FROM THE CUSTOMER"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5WRTHxxAW_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg5WRTHxxAW_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaron_M._Excellent_customer_service_The_design_team_did_an_excellent_job_and_we_are_so_pleased_to_have_a_precious_family_picture_transformed_into_such_a_cool_art_form..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggF6Lo7VUvD_text","label":"ggF6Lo7VUvD_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtuuWlj0zd_text","label":"ggtuuWlj0zd_text","default":"<p>Aaron M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY2-_puGNx_text","label":"ggY2-_puGNx_text","default":"<p>Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxDqr-JU7h_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggxDqr-JU7h_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Hilary_S._Super_easy_to_put_together._Comes_with_a_tool_to_use._But_I_placed_them_all_1_by_1._Reminded_me_alot_of_doing_diamond_art_pictures..jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo4vaccT-e_text","label":"ggo4vaccT-e_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggW1i1A5lVQ_text","label":"ggW1i1A5lVQ_text","default":"<p>Hilarty S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggz_XsIoGgb_text","label":"ggz_XsIoGgb_text","default":"<p>Super easy to put together. Comes with a tool to use. But I placed them all 1 by 1. Reminded me alot of doing diamond art pictures.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5HW0yu67J_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg5HW0yu67J_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaryn_C._So_easy_to_understand_and_a_nice_relaxing_project_for_my_free_time._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPla-Vf5GO_text","label":"ggPla-Vf5GO_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBuFCLS1iX_text","label":"ggBuFCLS1iX_text","default":"<p>Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguCAvQhZyo_text","label":"gguCAvQhZyo_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnGl8P633Q_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggnGl8P633Q_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Candice_L._I_split_the_photo_in_half_so_I_could_get_2_of_the_60x20_so_I_could_fill_my_wall_more_and_its_turned_out_AMAZING.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyZS4Dlpup_text","label":"ggyZS4Dlpup_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0Nj6LwyOB_text","label":"gg0Nj6LwyOB_text","default":"<p>Candice L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcFQ5vYa63_text","label":"ggcFQ5vYa63_text","default":"<p>I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaCVSGvY6e_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggaCVSGvY6e_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/John_R._It_was_a_fun_relaxing_task._My_wife_and_I_are_thrilled_to_have_our_wedding_photo_in_such_an_interesting_style.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-rnoHvIgX_text","label":"gg-rnoHvIgX_text","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR74GPgOlK_text","label":"ggR74GPgOlK_text","default":"<p>Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx4U7TYBCZ_text","label":"ggx4U7TYBCZ_text","default":"Replace this text with your content"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY9D5aQ69u_text","label":"ggY9D5aQ69u_text","default":"<p>We take photographs because we want to remember something.</p><p>But with thousands of images stored on our phones, it is easy for even our favorite moments to become just another file in a camera roll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Choosing one photograph and turning it into something physical gives that memory a chance to become part of everyday life again.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Memobrick, you can take the photograph that makes you smile, build it piece by piece, and eventually give it a place where you can see it every day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Because some photographs are too meaningful to spend their entire lives sitting inside your phone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Some memories deserve a place you can actually see.</strong></p>"}],
